cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Shopify B2B Order Portal
message: >-
  If you use this code, or build on the pattern it demonstrates, please credit
  the author and link back to this repository.
type: software
abstract: >-
  A wholesale order form for Shopify B2B that works without Shopify Plus:
  access gated on a single Liquid condition, catalog prices and volume breaks
  displayed rather than calculated, the catalog's quantity rule driving the
  input, and the whole order sent in one cart call. Clean-room, built on Dawn.
